          <caption>
            <p>Leydig Cell Tumor. This histological image&#x000a0;reveals sheets and cords of polygonal cells with abundant eosinophilic cytoplasm, round nuclei with prominent nucleoli, and pathognomonic eosinophilic Reinke crystals&#x02014;all set within a delicate, vascular stroma. Contributed by S Bhimji, MD</p>
          </caption>
